╍╍╍╍ Miami26 ╍╍╍╍

Fork of Nashville96 (by donfaustinocortizone) with gtk4 code nabbed from Redmond97-SE (by Silver_X) for GTK 4 support. I adjusted some of the colors along with redoing the color definitions. Works on MATE and Xfce.

I'm still learning gtk css so updates will not be frequent.


